1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:16,129
Its tail is short and stubby.

2
00:00:19,095 --> 00:00:22,127
It looks like a giant lizard.

3
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:29,292
I'm going to go ahead and take my time.

4
00:00:29,692 --> 00:00:44,321
Its tail gets bigger.

5
00:00:46,954 --> 00:00:57,851
Its tail is slimmer.

6
00:01:09,981 --> 00:01:20,478
Its tail gets smaller on the other side.

7
00:01:22,111 --> 00:01:27,676
The lizard is slithering.

8
00:01:34,508 --> 00:01:41,673
It looks a little stumpy.

9
00:01:50,237 --> 00:02:00,901
It runs fast through the grass and down the hill.

10
00:02:01,301 --> 00:02:08,999
It is on the staircase.

11
00:02:11,431 --> 00:02:13,931
The key is the tail.

12
00:02:14,364 --> 00:02:25,394
Its tail is so small, it's like a snake.

13
00:02:41,423 --> 00:02:44,989
It swoops.

14
00:02:46,488 --> 00:02:53,253
The tail is long and keeps moving.

15
00:02:55,553 --> 00:03:01,384
The stem gets bigger and stronger.

16
00:03:03,784 --> 00:03:09,216
The leaves grow slowly and become small and round.